| **Capital Protection** | [SafetyGatekeeper](file:///c:/Users/DDAPL/Downloads/nifty_trading_bot-main/nifty_trading_bot-main/core/safety_checks.py#4-196) | [check_funds()](file:///c:/Users/DDAPL/Downloads/nifty_trading_bot-main/nifty_trading_bot-main/core/safety_checks.py#41-92): Queries `rmsLimit` API. Requires (Margin * 1.1) buffer. |
| **Max Daily Loss** | [SafetyGatekeeper](file:///c:/Users/DDAPL/Downloads/nifty_trading_bot-main/nifty_trading_bot-main/core/safety_checks.py#4-196) | [check_max_daily_loss()](file:///c:/Users/DDAPL/Downloads/nifty_trading_bot-main/nifty_trading_bot-main/core/safety_checks.py#141-151): Halts if P&L < -₹2000. |
